# Copy to .secret-scan-local (gitignored) and list YOUR personal patterns —
# one case-insensitive extended-regex per line, # comments allowed.
#
# This is the deny-list for secret-scan.sh's personal-content class: names,
# places, vendors, account nicknames — facts a regex CAN catch once you name
# them. The list itself is personal data; it must never be committed, which
# is exactly why it lives in a gitignored file and CI skips this class.
#
# Examples (replace with your own):
# jane citizen
# exampletown
# acme renovations
# holiday fund saver
# \b1234567\b
